* ============================================================================
* 11b_table2_boottest.do — 野聚类自助法推断 Wild cluster bootstrap (A1)
* Paper: {{PAPER_ID}}
*
* V2.0 J-L-M 2026 稳健性对齐计划 §3 Phase 2 P2.A1:
*   对主回归做按 bank_id 聚类的 wild cluster bootstrap (G_bank=84)。
*   按 MacKinnon-Webb 2017 (Econometrics Journal), G≥30 满足 wild cluster
*   bootstrap 正则性。当前面板 G_year=2 → 不能按 year 聚类
*   (推迟到 Stage B 触发条件 T≥30)。
*
* 参考文献:
*   - Cameron, Gelbach & Miller (2008, REStat) wild cluster bootstrap
*   - MacKinnon-Webb 2017 (Econometrics Journal) small-G 情形
*   - Baron & Muir 2022 (RFS) 窄面板 SE 实务
*
* 把主回归系数 {{ATTITUDE_VAR}} 的常规聚类 SE p 值替换为 wild bootstrap p 值。
* 白话: 银行数 84 够做按银行聚类的 bootstrap 重抽推断, 但年份只有 2 个,
* 按年聚类在统计上站不住, 所以只按银行聚类; 本脚本对比两种 p 值是否接近作为验收。
* ============================================================================

version 19
clear all
set more off

if "$data_dir" == ""    global data_dir "../data"
if "$tables_dir" == ""  global tables_dir "../output/tables"

use "$data_dir/_prepared_panel.dta", clear

set seed {{RANDOM_SEED}}

* 重跑主回归, 为 boottest 准备 e() 上下文
quietly reghdfe {{MAIN_DV}}_w {{ATTITUDE_VAR}} $controls, ///
    absorb(bank_id year) vce(cluster {{CLUSTER_VAR}})
display "Main β: " _b[{{ATTITUDE_VAR}}] "  SE (cluster): " _se[{{ATTITUDE_VAR}}]

* 野聚类自助法推断 (boottest >=4.0)
capture which boottest
if _rc == 0 {
    boottest {{ATTITUDE_VAR}}=0, ///
        reps({{BOOTSTRAP_REPS}}) ///
        cluster(bank_id) ///
        seed({{RANDOM_SEED}}) ///
        nograph
    display _newline "Wild bootstrap p-value (cluster=bank_id, G=84, reps={{BOOTSTRAP_REPS}}): " r(p)

    * 验收标准 (AC-A1, plan §4): |p_wild - p_cluster| < 0.05
    scalar p_wild = r(p)
    quietly reghdfe {{MAIN_DV}}_w {{ATTITUDE_VAR}} $controls, ///
        absorb(bank_id year) vce(cluster {{CLUSTER_VAR}})
    * fix(omni-gapfill-16, 2026-06-12): p_cluster 由 normal() z 近似改 t(e(df_r))
    * — reghdfe 在 vce(cluster) 下按 t(G-1) 汇报 p 值 (e(df_r)=G-1), 旧 z 近似与
    * 表内 p 值口径不一致, AC-A1 差值含人为成分。
    scalar p_cluster = 2 * ttail(e(df_r), abs(_b[{{ATTITUDE_VAR}}] / _se[{{ATTITUDE_VAR}}]))
    scalar p_diff = abs(p_wild - p_cluster)
    display "p_cluster (cluster t, df=G-1): " p_cluster
    display "p_diff = " p_diff " (AC-A1: <0.05 required)"
    display "AC-A1 passes: " (p_diff < 0.05)
}
else {
    display "[WARN] boottest not installed. Run: ssc install boottest, replace"
    display "Wild bootstrap p-value unavailable; reverting to cluster SE only."
}

* 两种 SE 方法并排的附录表
* (实际 esttab 输出推迟到 Phase 5 集成、待 boottest 结果捕获后;
* 本模板作为独立诊断脚本运行。)

display "[OK] 11b boottest diagnostic complete"
